  "body": "We need to make sure that we're handling gappy `/syncs` correctly. It would be easy to think that we sent more state to the clients than we did, and we'll need to check this and write tests.\r\n\r\nTo do this, we'll first have to understand the existing code for tracking which state we have sent to clients. It looks entirely magical.",
